# name: test_prepared_bug_with_matching_diagnosis_upstream_does_not_redispatch_drift_analyzer
  '''
  telec sessions end self
  
  PREPARED: matching-drift-bug is ready for work.
  
  matching-drift-bug is prepared; any drift is reconciled. If you reached this as a terminal prepare, run the cleanup above and self-end. If you bounced here in-line from telec todo work matching-drift-bug to reconcile drift, skip the self-end and resume that work — you know your own lineage.
  '''
