# name: test_prepared_cleanup_is_unchanged_without_unblocked_children
  '''
  telec sessions end sess-parent-reviewer
  telec sessions end self
  
  PREPARED: parent is ready for work.
  
  parent is prepared; any drift is reconciled. If you reached this as a terminal prepare, run the cleanup above and self-end. If you bounced here in-line from telec todo work parent to reconcile drift, skip the self-end and resume that work — you know your own lineage.
  '''
